  "details": "When using the controller to scroll through menu's (such as when browsing worlds), the menu will shake up and down with head movement.\n\nIt's as if the scrollrect is inheriting inertia from your up/down head movement.\n\nThis makes scrolling through menus rather unpleasant on a headset.\n\nTo reproduce:\n\n1. Open a menu with a lot of options (e.g. the new worlds menu)\n\n2. Grab the menu with the controller trigger and begin to scroll with it.\n\n3. Shake your head up and down.",
